---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="About" description="Hanbeom's notes on solving problems across technology and teams." image={new URL("/og-about-en.png", Astro.site)} imageAlt="About The Work of Solving Problems" alternateKo={new URL("/about/", Astro.site)} alternateEn={new URL("/en/about/", Astro.site)}>
  <article class="post">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p><h1>Looking back at how I find and solve problems.</h1></header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I write about problems that involve technology, systems, and teams. I look at the real problem, the limits I faced, the choices I had, and what I did next.</p>
      <p>This is not only a list of success stories. I also write about unexpected results and what I would change next time.</p>
      <p>Each post starts with rough notes from my workday. AI makes Korean and English drafts at 1 p.m. Korea Standard Time. I check the details and approve each post before it goes live.</p>
      <p>Before a post goes live, I remove private work details. I do not share company or customer names, internal addresses, security details, contracts, or personal information.</p>
      <p>You can also see <a href="https://vumy.kr/">the services I built</a> from this way of solving problems.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
